                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Weird Creatures is an awesome game! I would highly recommend, when I put it on I didnt know what to expect and so I was greeted with a menu system to jump into the game of choice. I chose forest and that is where the fun began! Things are coming at you from all directions, upgrades, cool weapons, and weird creatures are all over! You have a companion there to assist you in your demolition of the creatures. Is it worth $10? There is enough depth to get lost in the game for hours or days! You drop $50 at a movie theater without batting an eyelash once you buy a ticket, your gf and a few drinks and popcorn. Worth it! Get it!",
